  "title": "Cedar Planked Halibut",
  "description": "Halibut steaks are ‘planked,’ barbequed on a water-soaked cedar plank, and basted with a succulent herb and butter sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Luke"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-10T03:05:23-04:00",
